Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:30.81,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Nächstes Mal bei\NAce of Diamond Act II – Second Season:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:36.89,TypePlaceholder,,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs22\an2\bord2\shad1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\fad(450,0)\pos(320,127)\b1}Nächstes Mal:\N{\fs38\bord2.2\shad1.3}„Der Stab“
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.37,0:23:32.31,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Der Stab!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:34.97,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Auf zum Landesturnier!

